<b>The Temporary Home, a Dojo for Reclamation</b>

The <b>Dragon Dojo</b> stands as a bastion of strength and discipline, a place where warriors are forged in flames. Perched on a secluded peak of enemy territory of the Draco’s, the Hydra Island, this dojo serves a singular purpose: to teach the art of the Dragon Talon, a fighting style that harnesses the mystical power of dragon flames.

Uzoth, the founder of the dojo, had seen it as more than just a training ground, but as a sanctuary for those who sought to unlock the wall that’s held students alike back from greatness, and achieve a scorching power. A place where they could learn to wield the Dragon Talon with precision, and grace. Construction from the strongest materials, and imbued with protective enchantments, the dojo is as resilient as the warriors who train within its boundaries.

The dojo was built to nurture the connections of the Dragon Talon flames from the magic that imbued them, helping students unlock their potential and understand the deeper meridians of their abilities.
